ebbd5356fedc3b36aeb38f9ef284077fbd31f"}, "selector": {"line": 48}}, {"after": "root boundary. The selected native ProjectId-registry owner supplies the exact92-byte PROJECT-ID-V1 frame, bounded complete registry, native incarnation, reservation/activation/recovery, explicit adoption and fence-to-lease lifetime rules; its acceptance does not imply native implementation or OS qualification.", "before": "root boundary.", "parent": {"bytes": 135448, "path": "docs/v2/contracts/product-v1/identity-and-evidence.md", "sha256": "c82404f3a0cf56fa6cc02e99cc3ebbd5356fedc3b36aeb38f9ef284077fbd31f"}, "selector": {"line": 51}}, {"after": "move with no live reader or writer, through native EXCLUSIVE on that N under the installation fence; duplicate simultaneous roots for one local namespace", "before": "move with no live writer; duplicate simultaneous roots for one local namespace", "parent": {"bytes": 135448, "path": "docs/v2/contracts/product-v1/identity-and-evidence.md", "sha256": "c82404f3a0cf56fa6cc02e99cc3ebbd5356fedc3b36aeb38f9ef284077fbd31f"}, "selector": {"line": 58}}, {"after": "**Native registry projection.** The selected registry owner distinguishes the complete RegistryDocument from RegisteredNamespaceList (ACTIVE and RETIRED N strings) and RegistryStartGate (zero RESERVED, prior active slot retired). RESERVED/ABANDONED rows grant no project lease. Retired registered N keeps its stable lease carriers; required unavailable carriers cannot be skipped or recreated. Ordinary contexts retain their admitted row and project handles/lease after releasing the fence, tolerating unrelated registry replacement.\n\n**Namespaces.** Every project lease names a namespace from the host namespace", "before": "**Namespaces.** Every project lease names a namespace from the host namespace", "parent": {"bytes": 119915, "path": "docs/v2/contracts/product-v1/security-and-lifecycle.md", "sha256": "a319da39b9f90aff4483a295af3fe004540c71861fb2bd34e84c7e1318bad9d6"}, "selector": {"line": 619}}, {"after": "**Native start gate.** Before writing a new installation-transition journal, validate the complete native RegistryDocument and RegistryStartGate even for same-schema core-update/core-repair with an empty affected lease set. Only the sorted RegisteredNamespaceList enters the unchanged registry/registryDigest fields and exact lease-set derivation. The native4096-entry limit is stricter than, and does not alter, generic NamespaceList.maxItems65536.\n\n**Journal (`InstallationTransitionJournalV1`; identity", "before": "**Journal (`InstallationTransitionJournalV1`; identity", "parent": {"bytes": 119915, "path": "docs/v2/contracts/product-v1/security-and-lifecycle.md", "sha256": "a319da39b9f90aff4483a295af3fe004540c71861fb2bd34e84c7e1318bad9d6"}, "selector": {"line": 917}}], "passageSupersessions": [], "selected": "docs/implementation/m2/project-registry-owner-selection-v1/successor.json", "sha256": "0909f44aa7ae2d7e441af06b933d137a22968d3872a9c367c81835b6da4828f4"}, {"inputs": [{"bytes": 2459, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v26/README.md", "sha256": "cadf8651cdcece299b799de06b2da096fa9f9320ca9c839fee0fe47f5b97f4d0"}, {"bytes": 105382, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v26/baseline.json", "sha256": "d3169737a884b1243af7524967e9acd0a72675ef8b879c3052043e47e0ed6e6c"}, {"bytes": 389, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v26/evidence/stage-command.json", "sha256": "5f591a18964d5c708667d6612ab8e79852ffcbdb5a4c9a7b70e62aea4e91550e"}, {"bytes": 0, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v26/evidence/stage.stderr", "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, {"bytes": 235, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v26/evidence/stage.stdout", "sha256": "1f9e77cdc5d500dea4ebee1accc6e4adbcb952dce727fca35e253beb45ec0a14"}, {"bytes": 106858, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v26/materialization-map.json", "sha256": "6b