 "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-definitions-r2/lead-resolution.json", "sha256": "1422baf2ec66c1db5e0c0b705a9923c01fcf2371b8789359822066628c0efe8a"}, {"bytes": 2477, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-definitions-r2/materialization-map.json", "sha256": "095a105dc4933c8b3a59ce843932791ece90c4bca3e9790e8053e4dbeb0878a0"}, {"bytes": 2776, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-definitions-r2/source.json", "sha256": "a5ea85fd8a8a9375e2e85195a46e3553da06927f2dbb02bf310eac8986f2cf09"}], "passageOverrides": [{"after": "## S8. Platform population and admission (AR-06)\n\n**O1-D1 r2 prospective operational definitions.** docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-definitions-r2/CONTRACT.md and exact machine definitions independently select O1-a guard source-pinned token-bounded credential profile/marker/defensive-gate behavior, initial nonempty K5 authority-derived catalog, and literal Platform/BuildProfile/IoErrorKind tables. BuildProfile observes only compiled debug-assertions on/off, preserving no-build-script/no-external-dependency and making no Cargo profile/inheritance/settings/harness/qualification claim. Platform reuses S8 machine ids as compile target-family facts only. P2 names stay disclosures/byte-identical; defective previews never emit. Existing source/authoritative loss/gate/first-I/O-error and command invariance remain; ring has no new loss matrix, pre-scope policy remains capability-dependent. Closed accepted SOP2 drafts are pinned context, not parents; O1-a then P/R/2b bind order remains. No RequestId mint, harness sink, ComponentRole, native authority, full O1-a or qualification follows.\n", "before": "## S8. Platform population and admission (AR-06)", "parent": {"bytes": 119915, "path": "docs/v2/contracts/product-v1/security-and-lifecycle.md", "sha256": "a319da39b9f90aff4483a295af3fe004540c71861fb2bd34e84c7e1318bad9d6"}, "selector": {"line": 680}}, {"after": "security-and-lifecycle.md (AR-06, DR-126); this matrix asserts platform-invariant design only and no QUALIFIED cell O1-D1 r2 prospectively selects the sorted unique union of this exact matrix capability ids and S8 machine platform ids as initial operational K5 release catalog, with pinned source receipts, fixed member digest and sealed controlled-source materialization. No capability availability/platform qualification/native/pack/component member or mint-list claim. See docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-definitions-r2/catalog-definition.json and CONTRACT.md.", "before": "security-and-lifecycle.md (AR-06, DR-126); this matrix asserts platform-invariant design only and no QUALIFIED cell", "parent": {"bytes": 36595, "path": "docs/coop/design-corrections/native/native-capability-matrix.v2.json", "sha256": "4b1c19b03a34a271718b1e7e79335aa6f0735affd7cd36018035eeb4e7b18a14"}, "selector": {"jsonPointer": "/platformBaselineOwner"}}], "passageSupersessions": [], "selected": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-definitions-r2/successor.json", "sha256": "caccf73411972b7b583c18669e36e338a082ceaa9f6e1452679789a484d7f060"}, {"inputs": [{"bytes": 1240, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-law-selection-r1/README.md", "sha256": "162d01d0d3192e8b5ec228533d8aaa6a9e282e74685138313e38cf716ae85298"}, {"bytes": 1571, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-law-selection-r1/selection-proof.json", "sha256": "e884f7f2a0a42b4b7023adb2e5037c99703ea324f9a5898647a05bec2b12cca0"}, {"bytes": 80638, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1/PROPOSAL-r2.md", "sha256": "987153221b913fc1c4cc729ecfabad397670502c8dc95a4bb292ebe0506bbbf0"}], "passageOverrides": [], "passageSupersessions": [], "selected": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-law-selection-r1/successor.json", "sha256": "5d0d9034d06b2917c45064a45fb009ef4f7729000fe8452b379f8a8afb0048f4"}, {"inputs": [{"bytes": 4005, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-package-policy-r1/CONTRACT.md", "sha256": "c4e76de24dc7e192087cc4c1fe1a097c10f982fd55c2aa23753eefb0bd8f4c66"}, {"bytes": 7741, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-package-policy-r1/package-policy.json", "sha256": "0961c2fd544f1288c72f1a0eda2dd581df85d10f3cb45e902503b1a754af8463"}], "passageOverrides": [{"after": "    O1-a's additive inventory successor binds its files with raw packages and pendingDecisions unchanged. The separately selected O1-PKG r1 effective package policy adds the opensip-operability row (rust-library, crates/operability, dependencies [opensip-platform]) and permits opensip-operability from host, storage and components. check_package_edges.py validates the current raw selected inventory together with that exact accepted policy through the full design-lock chain; declared and development edges are checked against the derived effective rows. See docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-package-policy-r1/CONTRACT.md and package-policy.json.", "before": "    O1-a's inventory successor adds the package row (`opensip-operability`, `rust-library`, `crates/operability`, dependencies `[opensip-platform]`) and adds `opensip-operability` to the allowed dependencies of host, storage and components. `check_package_edges.py` checks declared edges, development edges included, against that list (`tools/check_package_edges.py:35-55`).", "parent": {"bytes": 80638, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1/PROPOSAL-r2.md", "sha256": "987153221b913fc1c4cc729ecfabad397670502c8dc95a4bb292ebe0506bbbf0"}, "selector": {"line": 130}}, {"after": "  - the product's binding edge list is the current **selected repository-file inventory plus the separately selected O1-PKG r1 effective package policy**. check_package_edges.py verifies the complete design-lock chain and the policy's exact parent/candidate pins before deriving those permissions. O1-a's ACCEPT-UNIT file inventory stays additive with raw packages and pendingDecisions unchanged;", "before": "  - the product's binding edge list is the **selected repository-file inventory**, which `check_package_edges.py` enforces and which O1-a's inventory successor changes under `ACCEPT-UNIT` review;", "parent": {"bytes": 80638, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1/PROPOSAL-r2.md", "sha256": "987153221b913fc1c4cc729ecfabad397670502c8dc95a4bb292ebe0506bbbf0"}, "selector": {"line": 149}}, {"after": "| **O1-C1** | `crates/operability` forbids unsafe code; its manifest edges are exactly `{opensip-platform}`; `check_package_edges.py` passes on the current selected raw inventory plus the accepted O1-PKG r1 effective package policy after full design-lock/pin verification; host declares the edge; storage and components are only permitted. Raw inventory packages and pendingDecisions remain unchanged. | 1 | O1-a |", "before": "| **O1-C1** | `crates/operability` forbids unsafe code; its manifest edges are exactly `{opensip-platform}`; `check_package_edges.py` passes on the inventory successor; host declares the edge; storage and components are only permitted. | 1 | O1-a |", "parent": {"bytes": 80638, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1/PROPOSAL-r2.md", "sha256": "987153221b913fc1c4cc729ecfabad397670502c8dc95a4bb292ebe0506bbbf0"}, "selector": {"line": 558}}], "passageSupersessions": [], "selected": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/o1-package-policy-r1/successor.json", "sha256": "5f821758a5508119243282582d62d672361e4e0591c9718b41cdbacbfe758886"}, {"inputs": [{"bytes": 17867, "path": "docs/coop/artifacts/component-sdk-contract.v4.json", "sha256": "c53d541f12258eb96e86f0f5dbd3924a5f2e189d19c8f8672bae9037532461c3"}, {"bytes": 49989, "path": "docs/coop/completion/distribution-runtime-completion.v2.md", "sha256": "9ab2874edafa6e37ce9c552db50f985135ca311ab7be7570cfc41558e46ce0d1"}], "passageOverrides": [], "passageSupersessions": [], "selected": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/s-op-2/s-op-2-p/successor.json", "sha256": "9ea3ac08d2b12644a507b75fd7cc59b4a18e8af4a8cf9c3ca352e7a6cf070fd5"}, {"inputs": [{"bytes": 130001, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/operability/s-op-2/PROPOSAL-r6.md", "s