plementation/m3/snapshot-plan-c/native-workspace-owner-selection-r1/ select snapshot-member for an activated owner whose opaque package id is in workspace_members of the same admitted bundled metadata observation; other activated packages select dependency-closure-member, including nonworkspace path packages. A member used as a dependency remains snapshot-member. Actual producer/current activation/full source/lock/manifest/snapshot/custody joins are mandatory; membership is not inferred from null source, default-members, root/name/key/content/path equality or a caller witness. Package/member/used resolve/dependency ids join uniquely in that observation without parsing/deduplication/default/drop. All acquired candidates finish admission/rejection and all admitted candidates materialize whole before activation; inactive metadata omission is not a pruning license. Existing NKC-1/R3-MR1/CSJ-1 bytes and grant rules stay closed. Three actual synthetic fixture observations support this rule only; complete source/profile/namespace/failure/library/product/R3/effectiveL/O7/GT/qualification gates remain open.\n", "before": "### 5.1 Principal class `repository-code` and its joins (R4)", "parent": {"bytes": 329013, "path": "docs/v2/contracts/product-v1/native-evidence.md", "sha256": "83b99783893bec4bcca76bc043310e1d33305fc41ef85e012fbcb19e5b222ca0"}, "selector": {"line": 2397}}], "passageSupersessions": [], "selected": "docs/implementation/m3/snapshot-plan-c/native-workspace-owner-selection-r1/successor.json", "sha256": "b0b3a4c059f1f6abc7679378274c5165367b382c15da35da6cf8befbe4fd3a5a"}, {"inputs": [{"bytes": 5785, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/snapshot-plan-c/native-source-kind-r1/CONTRACT.md", "sha256": "c2fe66a03557474c1dbe027bf96add4e5ff3248d2d4bc28ab284a51c339111fe"}, {"bytes": 469, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/snapshot-plan-c/native-source-kind-r1/README.md", "sha256": "8a0f3e1a5a6985f9ffca4f5aa1c2db9ca4628feadf42ef319a4abf124398d400"}, {"bytes": 1992, "path": "docs/i