 the snapshot; nothing is imported.", "parent": {"bytes": 329013, "path": "docs/v2/contracts/product-v1/native-evidence.md", "sha256": "83b99783893bec4bcca76bc043310e1d33305fc41ef85e012fbcb19e5b222ca0"}, "selector": {"line": 1687}}, {"after": "**DS4-P1 prospective path membership compatibility.** Under the exact CONTRACT.md and membership.json at docs/implementation/m3/snapshot-plan-c/ds4-p1-r1/, new-M3 actually admitted nonworkspace DS-4 dependency owners remain dependency-closure-member but prove source membership through the security-owned sealed snapshot/current workspace/target/config/tool/metadata observation/path package capability and complete retained Native file array. The preceding sealed DependencySourceSetV1 id/package membership check remains unchanged for NONPATH owners; path bytes are not inserted/imported/transported in that nonpath set. Its invocation id and exact NIJ-1 wrapper joins stay mandatory. R3 recipes and all grant fields/principal/truth/consent/CI/live-boundary duties remain; actual library/source/profile/full failure admission is still gated.\n\n**Operational admission precedes any Plan (decided; SHOULD-2).** A grant", "before": "**Operational admission precedes any Plan (decided; SHOULD-2).** A grant", "parent": {"bytes": 119915, "path": "docs/v2/contracts/product-v1/security-and-lifecycle.md", "sha256": "a319da39b9f90aff4483a295af3fe004540c71861fb2bd34e84c7e1318bad9d6"}, "selector": {"line": 1115}}, {"after": "PROPOSED single closed public domain-detail registry; existing D9 class/code/exit remains unchanged C2PM-1 adds exactly native.closure-protocol-invalid for its external projection guards; existing records unchanged, D9 vocabulary unchanged. NIJ-1 prospectively adds native.input-import-invalid for its explicitly published native input preconditions; no new context-free alias. DS4-P1 selects its exact completion adding native.path-manifest-limit once for the actual complete path Native projection canonical bound; inherited records/aliases/meanings stay unchanged.", "before": "PROPOSED single closed public domain-detail registry; existing D9 class/code/exit remains unchanged C2PM-1 adds exactly native.closure-protocol-invalid for its external projection guards; existing records unchanged, D9 vocabulary unchanged. NIJ-1 prospectively adds native.input-import-invalid for its explicitly published native input preconditions; no new context-free alias.", "parent": {"bytes": 60309, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/snapshot-plan-c/nij-1-r1/completion/public-detail-registry.v1.json", "sha256": "98f837f4302abbb70c1979dc648817991c89d22b877fbadb593a853315359bf2"}, "selector": {"jsonPointer": "/standing"}}, {"after": "Generated/drift-checked from docs/coop/design-corrections/public-detail-registry.v1.json. Every owner joins the same closed registry; unknown names refuse. These details do not create D9 codes. C2PM-1 additionally selects native.closure-protocol-invalid under its exact successor public-detail registry. Existing isolated additions and all D9 meanings stay unchanged. NIJ-1 additionally selects native.input-import-invalid for external native-input join/precondition refusals; host invariant failures keep their existing detail. DS4-P1 prospectively selects its exact completion with native.path-manifest-limit appended once, preserving all inherited enum values/order/isolated additions and every D9 meaning.", "before": "Generated/drift-checked from docs/coop/design-corrections/public-detail-registry.v1.json. Every owner joins the same closed registry; unknown names refuse. These details do not create D9 codes. C2PM-1 additionally selects native.closure-protocol-invalid under its exact successor public-detail registry. Existing isolated additions and all D9 meanings stay unchanged. NIJ-1 additionally selects native.input-import-invalid for external native-input join/precondition refusals; host invariant failures keep their existing detail.", "parent": {"bytes": 55459, "path": "docs/implementation/m3/